<title>USA: IGT, Anchor Gaming in pact.</title>
<headline>IGT, Anchor Gaming in pact.</headline>
<dateline>RENO, Nev. 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>International Game Technology and Anchor Gaming Tuesday said they entered into a memorandum of understanding to form a strategic alliance.</p>
<p>In a statement, the companies said International Game and Anchor would cooperate in placing Anchor proprietary games, including Anchor's Wheel of Gold game, on International Game's wide area progressive systems in the United States and Canada. In addition, International Game would have rights to market Anchor's proprietary games throughout the rest of the world.</p>
</text>
